1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:10,820
How to use the TEG study cost price list

2
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:23,590
Open the price list page. All prices are in AUD; the data date is shown at the top right.

3
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:28,300
Still in Indonesia? Choose Offshore.

4
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:36,900
Already in Australia? Choose Onshore and read the visa note.

5
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:54,300
This box explains what the starting funds include and do not include.

6
00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:08,460
Search by course or school, then filter by city, field, level and budget.

7
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:18,570
Sort by cheapest; the green label marks the cheapest option.

8
00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:33,050
Click "Rincian biaya" to see the full cost breakdown and total starting funds.

9
00:01:33,650 --> 00:01:42,890
Read the notes, download a PDF for your parents, or tick "Compare".

10
00:01:43,490 --> 00:01:52,180
Select two or more courses and click "Compare" to see all costs side by side.

11
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:58,810
"Download hasil (PDF)" saves all the results you see.

12
00:01:59,410 --> 00:02:05,340
The ELICOS tab shows weekly English course fees.

13
00:02:05,940 --> 00:02:16,310
Pathway packages: VET at one school, then a Bachelor at another.

14
00:02:16,910 --> 00:02:33,570
VSA English lessons: Basic English from Rp1,100,000/month; PTE Foundation from Rp1,800,000/month.

15
00:02:34,170 --> 00:02:47,640
IELTS/PTE Preparation: online from Rp2,550,000, offline from Rp3,300,000 (30 hours).

16
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:57,510
Free mock test, placement test and consultation – click the chat button or scan the QR.

17
00:02:58,110 --> 00:03:12,060
All prices are estimates; final amounts follow the school's official offer letter.
